{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:12:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_b4c60094b5cd4e1c921e4ce136242946","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_53894fc2f45808cad821dd913758373a096f20faed346d4a57c4854d2bd0df07","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"nikitadmitrieff/auto-co-meta@5e6bb8a8765e snapshot 953e0670bb31dedd","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_399a7d1286928f396ccca517c9d8495c96eada7085ab6327796fce6f8947e613","slc_4fa8fd3863684b613c8b7f3435dbc6cabcc77913e54ba32c94d146096e00b679","slc_b951186aae736415441703645c60107851ad647db071e51fdc4c375b59b47214","slc_cc9d371bb8fcdf9d364a203cf6f109b6031c64e073882d69e283aab004f4c970"],"source_ids":["src_b2ef17814a4e5fd094a5e9d67c8b5984"],"text":"Repository development practice: CLAUDE.md instructs the operating agent instance to make auto-co production-ready, act autonomously without waiting for human approval, treat CEO (Bezos) as final decision-maker, and never modify safety red lines or break the loop.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:12:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b4c60094b5cd4e1c921e4ce136242946"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:12:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_b4c60094b5cd4e1c921e4ce136242946","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_7cf8828ffe631e7bb38aec20284d51442fb3deade8d44cbc03745b551e94ba6f","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"nikitadmitrieff/auto-co-meta@5e6bb8a8765e snapshot 953e0670bb31dedd","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_206fefb923d38c9a2b6489bb3ba7f590693f363e028a0478b8e1866c1fdaf76d","slc_98e3ab1d4f11f22df7b46eb6b9538150967b6694319ab11e9bdf2b2a821d89d5","slc_c76baa4b60db6aa27dad92c68adad383a4a4d824c83390ce4c636aacec42f0bc"],"source_ids":["src_93d3b59ca8435889a4804e3064894c54","src_d3897964fcf259719897dc37b935b802"],"text":"Agents append structured records to four append-only JSONL files under state/: decisions, tasks, metrics, and artifacts, each with a defined schema; these files must never be overwritten or truncated.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:12:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b4c60094b5cd4e1c921e4ce136242946"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:12:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_b4c60094b5cd4e1c921e4ce136242946","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_8bac5388a7862c739ce4f150b191cfc5d1c1a50cfc84e7ea8a45ba7fb7a3b3a3","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"nikitadmitrieff/auto-co-meta@5e6bb8a8765e snapshot 953e0670bb31dedd","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_421c65ff98fba52d7cbbfa2be3d92bc6585a914e2ee37d9b3058c8decd565ce0","slc_8fa019b1fda3d5931265fe8566fd11fdf438ced0aee0c7b0766b66684be23aad"],"source_ids":["src_19e7da2c9bc25b5fb8b4da92a7dc3b6f"],"text":"Configuration is environment-based via .env, with documented variables including MODEL (default sonnet), LOOP_INTERVAL (120s), CYCLE_TIMEOUT_SECONDS (1800s), MAX_CONSECUTIVE_ERRORS (3), and COOLDOWN_SECONDS (300).","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:12:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b4c60094b5cd4e1c921e4ce136242946"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:12:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_b4c60094b5cd4e1c921e4ce136242946","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a6c36e215eeca7d418b2f7a389a2e01d4ac4270965798689bafac833f9cd1aa1","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"nikitadmitrieff/auto-co-meta@5e6bb8a8765e snapshot 953e0670bb31dedd","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_05d266b96602545c819b594062aba235d923eb281045a7c4e873d61ae4ab9622","slc_a38de2262f0634c236b6778a9c930539572d7eababe727ba33953d4117bf6b35"],"source_ids":["src_3b703eb94fac525a82584ac59b1bdfa7"],"text":"Each cycle reads consensus.md, builds a prompt from PROMPT.md, calls 'claude -p', has agents update consensus, appends structured JSONL logs, then sleeps and repeats; each cycle selects 3-5 of the 14 relevant agents.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:12:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b4c60094b5cd4e1c921e4ce136242946"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:12:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_b4c60094b5cd4e1c921e4ce136242946","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a8b505c44e482774ae0d8d52ccb9ba7dc1df1cce8f8e2218aaa8d9843e2ba226","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"nikitadmitrieff/auto-co-meta@5e6bb8a8765e snapshot 953e0670bb31dedd","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_866af6b26ef7801e237b31ff7abf8cda75b89062d324c16d1a113ca626d456ab","slc_ab49bf2eb442d3fbd64e67a24ce01098ce01f122e07776cdafba4b28692c1f0b"],"source_ids":["src_3b703eb94fac525a82584ac59b1bdfa7"],"text":"Claude Code installed and working is listed as the prerequisite; the comparison table states the only dependency is Claude Code itself, with no framework or database required.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:12:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b4c60094b5cd4e1c921e4ce136242946"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:12:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_b4c60094b5cd4e1c921e4ce136242946","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b8d976f0cb09e9301e2c3c30d2d2020e352852401d942c7fddf5445d244a59f1","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"nikitadmitrieff/auto-co-meta@5e6bb8a8765e snapshot 953e0670bb31dedd","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_e31e92a6e789c5489f6b42faa47b588123c3c2e8c00d0a0d41aa3ebe656eccdd"],"source_ids":["src_3b703eb94fac525a82584ac59b1bdfa7"],"text":"auto-co is described as a bash loop that invokes Claude Code every two minutes, letting 14 AI agents debate, decide, build, and deploy software continuously without human supervision.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:12:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b4c60094b5cd4e1c921e4ce136242946"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:12:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_b4c60094b5cd4e1c921e4ce136242946","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c9fe278c0bbdac0610debda0408f1dc1b15947791c49d293626a6b4be2007ad5","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"nikitadmitrieff/auto-co-meta@5e6bb8a8765e snapshot 953e0670bb31dedd","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_c8a04d226f06a89b321f19e5b87d6bd2f6314a1523b1dd7f1a8877067677a980","slc_c90dc326038aba7304e46a10da83ae8586cf22c3aee9c27fee97f26166f0114e"],"source_ids":["src_19e7da2c9bc25b5fb8b4da92a7dc3b6f"],"text":"The loop includes resilience mechanisms: a circuit breaker after MAX_CONSECUTIVE_ERRORS failures with a cooldown, and automatic sleep of LIMIT_WAIT_SECONDS (default one hour) on API usage-limit errors.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:12:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b4c60094b5cd4e1c921e4ce136242946"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:12:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_b4c60094b5cd4e1c921e4ce136242946","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_dcd9ccd68aa128d21b14400f99a9a2ac6a5d5b69b7bf51efccf25c1ff072240d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"nikitadmitrieff/auto-co-meta@5e6bb8a8765e snapshot 953e0670bb31dedd","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_73b9514f0207ddc25d6596624e59a33060a18103deaa067ee055bb1e969acb8f"],"source_ids":["src_3b703eb94fac525a82584ac59b1bdfa7"],"text":"Key runtime files include auto-loop.sh (the loop with monitoring, error handling, and adaptive frequency), PROMPT.md (per-cycle system prompt), memories/consensus.md, .claude/agents/*.md personas, and a Makefile of commands.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:12:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b4c60094b5cd4e1c921e4ce136242946"}
